    "#### Protocol Selector\n",
    "##### First things first: can the robot see the ball?\n",
    "> ##### If not, the robot should immediately start defending.\n",
    "> ###### _`who the fuck cares what's going on? get back and defend, queen!`_\n",
    "##### If the robot doesn't have a protocol yet, it should first take its cues from its teammate.\n",
    "> ###### _`This might happen if the robot starts after its teammate (i.e. the pilot hit the start button a quarter second slower than on the other one). Alternatively, if the robot goes out of bounds and is replaced, it will start without a protocol active.`_\n",
    "> ##### If the teammate doesn't have a protocol either, then they should both start attacking because what else are ya gonna do?\n",
    "##### If the robot *does* have a protocol already, more nuance is required.\n",
    "> ##### If the robot is already attacking, it's fairly simple.\n",
    "> > ##### If either the robot or its teammate have control of the ball, it should keep attacking.\n",
    "> > ###### _`If we have the ball, why stop?`_\n",
    "> > ##### If the opposing team has the ball, then we should only keep pushing if the ball is ahead of the robot.\n",
    "> > ###### _`You bastard, I'll get you for that!`_\n",
    "> > > ##### If the ball is behind the robot, then we should go into defence mode\n",
    "> > > ###### _`Woah now, that's a step too far!`_\n",
    "> ##### If the robot is defending, it should only start attacking once the ball is  a bit past it\n",
    "> ###### _`Emergency over—GO, GO, GO!`_\n",
    "#### Main Loop\n",
    "###### Occurs every second\n",
    "##### Does the protocol selector still recommend the currently active protocol?\n",
    "> ##### If so, finish immediately and remain idle for another second.\n",
    "> ##### _`If it ain't broke, don't fix it!`_\n",
    "##### If not, replace the current protocol with the new one.\n",
    "> ##### Kill the current supbrocess, replace the `current_protocol` property with th new protocol, then instantiate a new subprocess with the new protocol.\n",
    "> ##### _`The king is dead; Long Live the King!`_"
